WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.360
Don't overthink it.

00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:07.340
Just relax.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.280
Let them see the man underneath.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.760
You know I've been asking myself,

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:17.580
what possible wisdom I could impart to the bright young minds of tomorrow.

00:00:20.700 --> 00:00:22.300
Be anyone you want to be.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:23.980
Figure out what you believe in.

00:00:23.980 --> 00:00:24.860
What makes you righteous,

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:25.500
angry.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.640
I believe in you, Sam.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.620
Get to the core of who you really are.

00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:34.360
We just cultivate that clean image.

00:00:34.660 --> 00:00:38.220
Nigel, my mother told me from an early age to fight for  justice,

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.740
protect those who are vulnerable.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.420
This is what we're selling: confidence, hope, optimism.

00:00:42.680 --> 00:00:45.220
Your mythology is your best asset.

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.720
Be honest about your weaknesses.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.120
Capitalize on your strengths.

00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:59.280
Because really you can only be you.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:01.900
Be you.

00:01:03.520 --> 00:01:04.920
Whoever that is.

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.180
Thank you.

00:01:06.740 --> 00:01:09.280
He's very very good at what he does.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.580
Fooling everyone.

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:11.920
The right man for the job then.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.400
Everyone's got a dark side,

00:01:13.520 --> 00:01:15.040
the more you get to see.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:19.200
There's two FBI agents that want to speak to you.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.460
Whatever mess you're in,

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.220
you need to get yourself out of it now.

00:01:22.360 --> 00:01:23.920
People are going to know what you really are.

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:26.580
I'd be careful here; sounds like you're fishing.

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:28.920
You'll write this story.

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:32.280
This is about you protecting your ticket to the top.

00:01:32.400 --> 00:01:34.200
Sam, about your zipper problem.

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:37.940
People want to believe that you're somehow better than they are.

00:01:37.940 --> 00:01:39.580
This is a black and white issue.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:41.020
They need that fairy tale.

00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:44.600
I set out to help people. I never said I was better than them.

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.640
Everyone's just waiting for you to win this.

00:01:47.740 --> 00:01:48.760
To Sam!

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:50.760
Do whatever you need to do to make it happen.

00:01:52.620 --> 00:01:54.220
This is the perfect time

00:01:54.380 --> 00:01:56.400
to get used to surprises.

00:02:05.120 --> 00:02:06.180
What did you do?

00:02:06.360 --> 00:02:09.360
Remember all the goals we set for ourselves? Let's not throw that away.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:12.680
People still need heroes.

00:02:13.180 --> 00:02:14.460
Let's give 'em one.

